  "body": [
    {
      "from": 0.0,
      "to": 1.1,
      "sid": 1,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Lu Xun once said",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1.1,
      "to": 2.62,
      "sid": 2,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Florida doesn't tolerate idleness",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 2.62,
      "to": 5.54,
      "sid": 3,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many of the crazy incidents in the U.S. happen in Florida",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 5.54,
      "to": 7.9,
      "sid": 4,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For instance, a Florida man broke into someone's house",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 7.9,
      "to": 8.56,
      "sid": 5,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "didn't take anything",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 8.56,
      "to": 10.0,
      "sid": 6,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and only shaved the cat's head",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 10.0,
      "to": 12.0,
      "sid": 7,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Another Florida man broke into a prison",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 12.0,
      "to": 13.29,
      "sid": 8,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "just to hang out with his friends",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 13.29,
      "to": 16.31,
      "sid": 9,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Official statistics actually echo these bizarre news stories",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 16.31,
      "to": 18.41,
      "sid": 10,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "17.5% of Florida's residents",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 18.41,
      "to": 19.41,
      "sid": 11,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which is about 3 million people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 19.41,
      "to": 20.81,
      "sid": 12,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "do indeed have mental illnesses",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 20.81,
      "to": 23.25,
      "sid": 13,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "making Florida the state with the highest number of mentally ill individuals in the U.S.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 23.25,
      "to": 24.54,
      "sid": 14,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and among these, the most dangerous",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 24.54,
      "to": 26.3,
      "sid": 15,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "criminals with mental illnesses are detained at",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 26.3,
      "to": 28.94,
      "sid": 16,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a very remote African American town where I'm heading today",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 28.94,
      "to": 31.36,
      "sid": 17,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the Florida State Hospital in Chattahoochee",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 31.36,
      "to": 33.16,
      "sid": 18,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which has a population of just 2,955 people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 33.16,
      "to": 34.56,
      "sid": 19,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "50.5% are Black",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 34.56,
      "to": 35.92,
      "sid": 20,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "41% are White",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 35.92,
      "to": 37.5,
      "sid": 21,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are only 22 Asians in total",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 37.5,
      "to": 39.92,
      "sid": 22,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And only two Chinese people work in psychiatric hospitals",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 39.92,
      "to": 40.48,
      "sid": 23,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Coincidentally",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 40.48,
      "to": 41.98,
      "sid": 24,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "One of them is a pen pal from my channel",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 41.98,
      "to": 44.38,
      "sid": 25,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let's have him share his bizarre experiences working there",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 44.38,
      "to": 46.16,
      "sid": 26,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is a specialized forensic psychiatric hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 46.16,
      "to": 48.29,
      "sid": 27,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "We don't take patients from the community",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 48.29,
      "to": 50.03,
      "sid": 28,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In a rather remote location",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 50.03,
      "to": 52.099,
      "sid": 29,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "about an hour from the nearest city, Tallahassee",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 52.099,
      "to": 54.079,
      "sid": 30,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which is around 50 minutes away",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 54.079,
      "to": 57.399,
      "sid": 31,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "on the border between Florida and Georgia",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 57.399,
      "to": 58.399,
      "sid": 32,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "theoretically speaking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 58.399,
      "to": 59.679,
      "sid": 33,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "once you get to the hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 59.679,
      "to": 63.65,
      "sid": 34,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you can walk from Florida into Georgia",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 63.65,
      "to": 65.77,
      "sid": 35,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "since you have mental health issues",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 65.77,
      "to": 66.63,
      "sid": 36,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you wouldn't be held responsible",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 66.63,
      "to": 68.37,
      "sid": 37,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is a rather special plea.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 68.37,
      "to": 70.92,
      "sid": 38,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As commonly said, if you have a mental illness, you can kill without legal repercussions.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 70.92,
      "to": 72.28,
      "sid": 39,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because you have a mental disorder,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 72.28,
      "to": 74.52,
      "sid": 40,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you are not considered guilty in a legal sense.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 74.52,
      "to": 77.24,
      "sid": 41,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "However, you still have to undergo mandatory treatment and such.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 77.24,
      "to": 78.82,
      "sid": 42,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can't just run around on the streets freely.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 78.82,
      "to": 81.22,
      "sid": 43,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You would be placed in a forensic psychiatric hospital,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 81.22,
      "to": 83.62,
      "sid": 44,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or in a general psychiatric hospital’s",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 83.62,
      "to": 86.04,
      "sid": 45,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "forensic ward for long-term treatment.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 86.04,
      "to": 89.6,
      "sid": 46,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Until the court, this judicial system, and this mental health institution all say",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 89.6,
      "to": 90.84,
      "sid": 47,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Oh, it seems like you're fine",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 90.84,
      "to": 93.2,
      "sid": 48,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can be conditionally released back into the community",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 93.2,
      "to": 94.94,
      "sid": 49,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Many people find this absurd",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 94.94,
      "to": 96.06,
      "sid": 50,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But on the other hand",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 96.06,
      "to": 98.64,
      "sid": 51,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The court is still quite cautious when making these decisions",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 98.64,
      "to": 99.86,
      "sid": 52,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They do take various factors into consideration, right",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 99.86,
      "to": 101.18,
      "sid": 53,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Your behavior in the case",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 101.18,
      "to": 104.34,
      "sid": 54,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Whether it demonstrated any logic and planning",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 104.34,
      "to": 105.02,
      "sid": 55,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In other words",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 105.02,
      "to": 107.3,
      "sid": 56,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a typical murder is almost impossible to pin a charge on",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 107.3,
      "to": 109.22,
      "sid": 57,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because your planning is too obvious",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 109.22,
      "to": 112.24,
      "sid": 58,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's clear that you did this to cover up the crime",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 112.24,
      "to": 113.0,
      "sid": 59,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to dispose of the evidence",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 113.0,
      "to": 113.7,
      "sid": 60,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to commit the murder",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 114.8,
      "to": 116.76,
      "sid": 61,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "these kinds of actions show too much planning",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 116.76,
      "to": 117.64,
      "sid": 62,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to get into such a situation in a regular class",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 117.64,
      "to": 119.34,
      "sid": 63,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "usually people here act in this way",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 119.34,
      "to": 120.58,
      "sid": 64,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The logic is particularly muddled.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 120.58,
      "to": 122.34,
      "sid": 65,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It might also be related to some history.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 122.34,
      "to": 123.38,
      "sid": 66,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A mental illness episode occurred.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 123.38,
      "to": 125.08,
      "sid": 67,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And then they killed their family members.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 125.08,
      "to": 126.62,
      "sid": 68,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Including their father or mother.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 126.62,
      "to": 127.34,
      "sid": 69,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are various scenarios.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 127.34,
      "to": 129.94,
      "sid": 70,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For example, some people might feel that their father or mother",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 129.94,
      "to": 130.88,
      "sid": 71,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Was possessed by Satan.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 130.88,
      "to": 133.56,
      "sid": 72,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or in that moment, they felt their family was trying to harm them.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 133.56,
      "to": 134.06,
      "sid": 73,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 134.06,
      "to": 137.47,
      "sid": 74,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he might, for instance, grab a knife and stab to death impulsively",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 137.47,
      "to": 139.91,
      "sid": 75,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and afterwards, he would undoubtedly feel extremely remorseful",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 139.91,
      "to": 140.71,
      "sid": 76,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "crying bitterly",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 140.71,
      "to": 141.59,
      "sid": 77,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "situations like this",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 141.59,
      "to": 143.71,
      "sid": 78,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "are often unplanned",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 143.71,
      "to": 144.7,
      "sid": 79,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because if they",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 144.7,
      "to": 147.72,
      "sid": 80,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "have had long-standing conflicts with their parents",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 147.72,
      "to": 149.1,
      "sid": 81,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you might naturally suspect them",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 149.1,
      "to": 151.7,
      "sid": 82,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But some families actually have a very good relationship",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 151.7,
      "to": 153.28,
      "sid": 83,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But at that moment",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 153.28,
      "to": 155.44,
      "sid": 84,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He might suddenly not recognize his parents",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 155.44,
      "to": 156.8,
      "sid": 85,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And he felt that someone was trying to harm him",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 156.8,
      "to": 158.0,
      "sid": 86,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And this person was getting closer to me",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 158.0,
      "to": 158.92,
      "sid": 87,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He would grab whatever was at hand",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 158.92,
      "to": 160.76,
      "sid": 88,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If he mentioned a clear goal or purpose in this belief",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 160.76,
      "to": 162.66,
      "sid": 89,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A very specific target or objective",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 162.66,
      "to": 164.86,
      "sid": 90,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then in most cases, if the police found this item",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 164.86,
      "to": 166.06,
      "sid": 91,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Basically, if you don’t know how to do it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 166.06,
      "to": 168.48,
      "sid": 92,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Often, it might end up hurting someone",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 168.48,
      "to": 170.62,
      "sid": 93,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "No matter how you look into it, there seems to be no conflict",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 170.62,
      "to": 171.96,
      "sid": 94,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Maybe while driving on the street",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 171.96,
      "to": 173.64,
      "sid": 95,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He already had a gun, after all",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 173.64,
      "to": 174.42,
      "sid": 96,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You know, being an American",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 174.42,
      "to": 177.5,
      "sid": 97,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then suddenly, he might think someone is out to get him",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 177.5,
      "to": 179.9,
      "sid": 98,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And he starts running around, firing his gun randomly",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 179.9,
      "to": 181.7,
      "sid": 99,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can see the whole process",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 181.7,
      "to": 183.9,
      "sid": 100,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He didn’t have any specific goals in mind.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 183.9,
      "to": 185.78,
      "sid": 101,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He didn’t mention targeting anyone in particular.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 185.78,
      "to": 187.46,
      "sid": 102,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He didn’t say he had to achieve anything with anyone.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 187.46,
      "to": 188.62,
      "sid": 103,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He just felt that someone was chasing him.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 188.62,
      "to": 189.58,
      "sid": 104,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He didn’t know who this person was.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 189.58,
      "to": 190.5,
      "sid": 105,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After saying he might have hurt someone,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 190.5,
      "to": 192.1,
      "sid": 106,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he asked if the person was still there.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 192.1,
      "to": 192.8,
      "sid": 107,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He didn’t run away,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 192.8,
      "to": 194.48,
      "sid": 108,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he just stayed where he was.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 194.48,
      "to": 195.32,
      "sid": 109,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The police arrived",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 195.32,
      "to": 197.0,
      "sid": 110,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and asked, gun in hand, what you were doing",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 197.0,
      "to": 198.72,
      "sid": 111,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He told the police about this person",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 198.72,
      "to": 199.6,
      "sid": 112,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Is this person Satan?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 199.6,
      "to": 200.8,
      "sid": 113,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "When he was doing these things",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 200.8,
      "to": 202.32,
      "sid": 114,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he might not have considered the severity of his actions",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 202.32,
      "to": 203.18,
      "sid": 115,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Once it was done",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 203.18,
      "to": 203.8,
      "sid": 116,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he wasn't afraid",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 203.8,
      "to": 204.36,
      "sid": 117,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he didn't run",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 204.36,
      "to": 207.33,
      "sid": 118,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Since these patients attack people quite randomly",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 207.33,
      "to": 209.33,
      "sid": 119,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "do you think working in this hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 209.33,
      "to": 211.19,
      "sid": 120,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "poses any safety risks?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 211.19,
      "to": 213.25,
      "sid": 121,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I don’t feel particularly at risk mentally",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 213.25,
      "to": 214.17,
      "sid": 122,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but objectively speaking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 214.17,
      "to": 216.08,
      "sid": 123,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "even during our training",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 216.08,
      "to": 217.76,
      "sid": 124,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it was repeatedly emphasized to us",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 217.76,
      "to": 219.36,
      "sid": 125,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "that you should never turn your back on them",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 219.36,
      "to": 221.36,
      "sid": 126,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it’s best to keep your back against the wall",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 221.36,
      "to": 222.42,
      "sid": 127,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let them go first",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 222.42,
      "to": 223.96,
      "sid": 128,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It still feels a bit like a prison",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 223.96,
      "to": 226.1,
      "sid": 129,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Look, they can't get out of any of the doors",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 226.1,
      "to": 228.02,
      "sid": 130,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have to find an employee to open the door",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 228.02,
      "to": 228.82,
      "sid": 131,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I have the key",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 228.82,
      "to": 230.7,
      "sid": 132,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So, it's suggested that I open the door when",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 230.7,
      "to": 231.42,
      "sid": 133,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The patient needs to leave",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 231.42,
      "to": 231.9,
      "sid": 134,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Just ask him",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 231.9,
      "to": 232.54,
      "sid": 135,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What are you doing here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 232.54,
      "to": 234.9,
      "sid": 136,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Make sure there are no patients who are particularly close to him.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 234.9,
      "to": 235.84,
      "sid": 137,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In situations like this,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 235.84,
      "to": 237.8,
      "sid": 138,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the hospital is divided into two sections,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 237.8,
      "to": 240.51,
      "sid": 139,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "one with more comprehensive functions,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 240.51,
      "to": 243.29,
      "sid": 140,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "where patients generally behave well.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 243.29,
      "to": 245.09,
      "sid": 141,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So, working there is a bit easier.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 245.09,
      "to": 249.05,
      "sid": 142,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Recently, I've started to work in the forensic area,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 249.05,
      "to": 250.45,
      "sid": 143,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "where the patients are,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 250.45,
      "to": 252.29,
      "sid": 144,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "likely just admitted to the psychiatric hospital.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 252.29,
      "to": 254.66,
      "sid": 145,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So they generally have a shorter treatment period",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 254.66,
      "to": 255.78,
      "sid": 146,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They tend to be more aggressive",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 255.78,
      "to": 257.4,
      "sid": 147,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or the place has very strict rules",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 257.4,
      "to": 259.329,
      "sid": 148,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Including security checks when we enter",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 259.329,
      "to": 260.809,
      "sid": 149,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "No electronic devices are allowed",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 260.809,
      "to": 262.529,
      "sid": 150,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have many more locks on their doors",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 262.529,
      "to": 264.569,
      "sid": 151,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How exactly do you conduct the treatment?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 264.569,
      "to": 265.769,
      "sid": 152,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Each person's issues are different",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 265.769,
      "to": 267.169,
      "sid": 153,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For example, schizophrenia",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 267.169,
      "to": 268.009,
      "sid": 154,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Conditions like this",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 268.009,
      "to": 270.5,
      "sid": 155,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you need to tell them to take their medication",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 270.5,
      "to": 273.2,
      "sid": 156,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "taking medication regularly is absolutely crucial",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 273.2,
      "to": 274.86,
      "sid": 157,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "conduct some mental health education",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 274.86,
      "to": 276.44,
      "sid": 158,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "including what this condition is about",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 276.44,
      "to": 277.789,
      "sid": 159,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "why you might have it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 277.789,
      "to": 278.069,
      "sid": 160,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "why you have it",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 278.069,
      "to": 279.629,
      "sid": 161,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and how important it is to take the medication afterward",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 279.629,
      "to": 281.309,
      "sid": 162,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "what benefits taking the medication can bring to your condition",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 281.309,
      "to": 284.149,
      "sid": 163,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then there are some people who might also have issues with emotional regulation.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 284.149,
      "to": 285.849,
      "sid": 164,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Their ability to control their behavior is also relatively poor.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 285.849,
      "to": 287.48,
      "sid": 165,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They can get angry quite easily, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 287.48,
      "to": 289.54,
      "sid": 166,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And when they get angry, they might become quite aggressive.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 289.54,
      "to": 290.84,
      "sid": 167,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So you need to talk to them about it, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 290.84,
      "to": 291.84,
      "sid": 168,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Why do you get angry?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 291.84,
      "to": 294.36,
      "sid": 169,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How do you manage your anger when you feel it?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 294.36,
      "to": 295.0,
      "sid": 170,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because, you see,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 295.0,
      "to": 296.64,
      "sid": 171,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you don’t manage it, you could end up in trouble.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 296.64,
      "to": 297.92,
      "sid": 172,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even after you go out and come back",
