      "sid": 279,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "allow a Switch in their ward.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 493.18,
      "to": 494.14,
      "sid": 280,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As long as it's not connected to the internet",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 494.14,
      "to": 494.84,
      "sid": 281,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You can play on your own",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 494.84,
      "to": 496.24,
      "sid": 282,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But most patients can't afford it either",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 496.24,
      "to": 498.16,
      "sid": 283,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's because many families are really poor",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 498.16,
      "to": 499.92,
      "sid": 284,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And many other wards don't allow",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 499.92,
      "to": 502.68,
      "sid": 285,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even things like a switch aren't allowed, but reading books is fine",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 502.68,
      "to": 504.16,
      "sid": 286,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Books with hard covers are not allowed",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 504.16,
      "to": 506.08,
      "sid": 287,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because you know, that stuff can be used to hurt people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 506.08,
      "to": 507.44,
      "sid": 288,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because the hard cover is very hard",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 507.44,
      "to": 508.28,
      "sid": 289,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And there's a pointy part.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 508.28,
      "to": 510.99,
      "sid": 290,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Maybe everyone can play some cards or board games.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 510.99,
      "to": 512.27,
      "sid": 291,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That works.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 512.27,
      "to": 515.58,
      "sid": 292,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But many patients aren't really interested.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 515.58,
      "to": 518.28,
      "sid": 293,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Looks like your living environment is pretty good.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 518.28,
      "to": 520.4,
      "sid": 294,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It sounds not so bad.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 520.4,
      "to": 522.88,
      "sid": 295,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But in reality, no patient wants to stay.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 522.88,
      "to": 523.76,
      "sid": 296,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's still the thing.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 523.76,
      "to": 526.1,
      "sid": 297,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Humans still don't like a life without freedom.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 526.1,
      "to": 528.74,
      "sid": 298,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's about how everything you do every day is monitored by others.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 528.74,
      "to": 530.58,
      "sid": 299,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "First, let me talk about the ward I work in.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 530.58,
      "to": 531.97,
      "sid": 300,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's exclusively for men.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 531.97,
      "to": 533.61,
      "sid": 301,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I haven't worked in the women's ward.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 533.61,
      "to": 536.26,
      "sid": 302,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So, I don't have much insight into that side of things.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 536.26,
      "to": 538.54,
      "sid": 303,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are more Black patients, yeah.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 538.54,
      "to": 541.06,
      "sid": 304,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Probably around 40% to 50% are Black.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 541.06,
      "to": 543.58,
      "sid": 305,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then about 40% are White, right.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 543.58,
      "to": 545.02,
      "sid": 306,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The rest are Latino.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 545.02,
      "to": 547.26,
      "sid": 307,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And there are even some Asians",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 547.26,
      "to": 551.75,
      "sid": 308,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "who are in social classes that are objectively higher",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 551.75,
      "to": 553.35,
      "sid": 309,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "who get into these troubles",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 553.35,
      "to": 554.61,
      "sid": 310,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "dealing with the justice system",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 554.61,
      "to": 556.01,
      "sid": 311,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and have these mental health issues",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 556.01,
      "to": 559.21,
      "sid": 312,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "which are indeed related to their long-term poverty",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 559.21,
      "to": 560.97,
      "sid": 313,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "as well as their level of education",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 560.97,
      "to": 561.89,
      "sid": 314,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "objectively speaking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 561.89,
      "to": 564.39,
      "sid": 315,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the lack of a support system in their lives also plays a role",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 564.39,
      "to": 565.99,
      "sid": 316,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because if you have a support system",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 565.99,
      "to": 568.059,
      "sid": 317,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you're less likely to turn to crime",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 568.059,
      "to": 570.699,
      "sid": 318,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Some people just don't have good family support",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 570.699,
      "to": 572.419,
      "sid": 319,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And that's partly due to cultural reasons",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 572.419,
      "to": 573.739,
      "sid": 320,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "American culture might differ from Chinese culture",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 573.739,
      "to": 574.219,
      "sid": 321,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As you know",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 574.219,
      "to": 574.699,
      "sid": 322,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In China",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 574.699,
      "to": 577.36,
      "sid": 323,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Let's say you have a relative",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 577.36,
      "to": 578.66,
      "sid": 324,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "who is wandering the streets",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 578.66,
      "to": 580.74,
      "sid": 325,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If this matter gets known by people around you",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 580.74,
      "to": 582.62,
      "sid": 326,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it could really affect your reputation",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 582.62,
      "to": 583.9,
      "sid": 327,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but this kind of thing might not happen in the United States",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 583.9,
      "to": 586.16,
      "sid": 328,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "some people might have been in and out of prison",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 586.16,
      "to": 588.68,
      "sid": 329,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or psychiatric hospitals for over a decade",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 588.68,
      "to": 590.92,
      "sid": 330,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "their families might have abandoned them when they were very young",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 590.92,
      "to": 592.92,
      "sid": 331,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or just don't keep in touch much, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 592.92,
      "to": 593.72,
      "sid": 332,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like many of them",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 593.72,
      "to": 596.2,
      "sid": 333,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "used to sell medicine on the streets",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 596.2,
      "to": 597.2,
      "sid": 334,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the other hand,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 597.2,
      "to": 600.52,
      "sid": 335,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "if you have the financial means or resources at home,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 600.52,
      "to": 602.2,
      "sid": 336,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you can start treatment earlier,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 602.2,
      "to": 603.93,
      "sid": 337,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and it won't progress to this stage.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 603.93,
      "to": 605.57,
      "sid": 338,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's not just about money,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 605.57,
      "to": 607.15,
      "sid": 339,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I think it's also about awareness.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 607.15,
      "to": 608.49,
      "sid": 340,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is true in other countries as well,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 608.49,
      "to": 610.33,
      "sid": 341,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "for example, in more rural areas,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 610.33,
      "to": 613.28,
      "sid": 342,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there's often less understanding of mental health issues.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 613.28,
      "to": 615.02,
      "sid": 343,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "People think this person is not acting right",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 615.02,
      "to": 616.7,
      "sid": 344,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but no one would say it out loud",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 616.7,
      "to": 617.7,
      "sid": 345,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If someone is not acting right",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 617.7,
      "to": 620.18,
      "sid": 346,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they should go to the hospital for treatment, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 620.18,
      "to": 620.94,
      "sid": 347,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Overall",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 620.94,
      "to": 622.94,
      "sid": 348,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there's a lack of understanding about mental health",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 622.94,
      "to": 624.14,
      "sid": 349,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or how it affects people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 624.14,
      "to": 625.58,
      "sid": 350,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is true in many countries",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 625.58,
      "to": 626.66,
      "sid": 351,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and you can see the same issues there",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 626.66,
      "to": 629.04,
      "sid": 352,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Especially if you're living in those poor communities",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 629.04,
      "to": 630.679,
      "sid": 353,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "People think mental health",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 630.679,
      "to": 631.939,
      "sid": 354,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is purely nonsense, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 631.939,
      "to": 632.979,
      "sid": 355,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How could humans have such things?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 632.979,
      "to": 634.319,
      "sid": 356,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The ratio of patients to doctors",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 634.319,
      "to": 637.22,
      "sid": 357,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And the ratio of patients to staff members",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 637.22,
      "to": 640.02,
      "sid": 358,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Ego is somewhat particularly strict, to be precise",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 640.02,
      "to": 640.42,
      "sid": 359,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They said",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 640.42,
      "to": 641.5,
      "sid": 360,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm not a doctor either",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 641.5,
      "to": 642.74,
      "sid": 361,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm not a doctor either.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 642.74,
      "to": 646.54,
      "sid": 362,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "We don't need too many people who can diagnose patients here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 646.54,
      "to": 648.13,
      "sid": 363,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Since it's a psychiatric hospital, after all.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 648.13,
      "to": 651.29,
      "sid": 364,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Mostly, we need some psychiatrists.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 651.29,
      "to": 653.49,
      "sid": 365,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And a few psychologists are sufficient.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 653.49,
      "to": 655.22,
      "sid": 366,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "We don't need a lot of them.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 655.22,
      "to": 656.62,
      "sid": 367,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Including psychiatrists.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 656.62,
      "to": 657.82,
      "sid": 368,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "These kinds of jobs, you know,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 657.82,
      "to": 660.19,
      "sid": 369,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "require a lot of education.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 660.19,
      "to": 661.27,
      "sid": 370,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You should pursue an undergraduate degree.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 661.27,
      "to": 661.91,
      "sid": 371,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You should go on to get your Ph.D.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 661.91,
      "to": 663.29,
      "sid": 372,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After completing your Ph.D., you'll need to do some internships.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 663.29,
      "to": 664.03,
      "sid": 373,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Once the internship is over,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 664.03,
      "to": 664.67,
      "sid": 374,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "let me explain,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 664.67,
      "to": 665.59,
      "sid": 375,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you'll need to complete another Ph.D.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 665.59,
      "to": 667.91,
      "sid": 376,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "later, you'll accumulate enough clinical practice,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 667.91,
      "to": 670.13,
      "sid": 377,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and finally, you'll go and get your license.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 670.13,
      "to": 671.73,
      "sid": 378,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This process is quite lengthy.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 671.73,
      "to": 672.69,
      "sid": 379,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They're referred to as outsiders",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 672.69,
      "to": 675.48,
      "sid": 380,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "simply because there aren't as many locals",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 675.48,
      "to": 677.78,
      "sid": 381,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "with this qualification",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 677.78,
      "to": 680.74,
      "sid": 382,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a psychologist can handle over a hundred patients",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 680.74,
      "to": 681.12,
      "sid": 383,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "forty",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 681.12,
      "to": 684.57,
      "sid": 384,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "so there aren't that many in the entire hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 684.57,
      "to": 686.59,
      "sid": 385,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but it depends on how you define a psychologist",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 686.59,
      "to": 690.35,
      "sid": 386,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "if you consider all those with a master’s degree",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 690.35,
      "to": 691.55,
      "sid": 387,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "to be qualified",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 691.55,
      "to": 694.17,
      "sid": 388,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That's roughly thirty to forty.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 694.17,
      "to": 695.25,
      "sid": 389,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Something like that.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 695.25,
      "to": 697.45,
      "sid": 390,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But with a doctoral degree.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 697.45,
      "to": 701.28,
      "sid": 391,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Really has the capability to write reports for the court.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 701.28,
      "to": 702.26,
      "sid": 392,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There aren't many people.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 702.26,
      "to": 704.54,
      "sid": 393,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That requires a doctoral degree.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 704.54,
      "to": 705.81,
      "sid": 394,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 705.81,
      "to": 709.07,
      "sid": 395,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And also a relevant license for such a psychologist.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 709.07,
      "to": 710.83,
      "sid": 396,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There might only be three people.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 710.83,
      "to": 711.77,
      "sid": 397,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's still two people",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 711.77,
      "to": 712.55,
      "sid": 398,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Psychologist",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 712.55,
      "to": 714.29,
      "sid": 399,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They're usually either white",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 714.29,
      "to": 715.23,
      "sid": 400,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or more Asian",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 715.23,
      "to": 718.579,
      "sid": 401,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and the local staff are mostly Black, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 718.579,
      "to": 719.779,
      "sid": 402,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Is that the vibe?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 719.779,
      "to": 720.779,
      "sid": 403,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There are a lot of employees",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 720.779,
      "to": 721.419,
      "sid": 404,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "a significant number of",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 721.419,
      "to": 723.319,
      "sid": 405,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like the teachers who give the classes",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 723.319,
      "to": 724.019,
      "sid": 406,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Nurse",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 724.019,
      "to": 726.02,
      "sid": 407,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The hospital even has its own fire station",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 726.02,
      "to": 727.4,
      "sid": 408,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and its own police station",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 727.4,
      "to": 728.3,
      "sid": 409,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like the cafeteria or something",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 728.3,
      "to": 730.98,
      "sid": 410,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "We currently have around 1,300 patients",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 730.98,
      "to": 732.75,
      "sid": 411,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and probably over 2,000 staff members",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 732.75,
      "to": 734.75,
      "sid": 412,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I don’t think this job is particularly great",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 734.75,
      "to": 737.91,
      "sid": 413,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "All state government jobs aren’t that high up either",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 737.91,
      "to": 738.97,
      "sid": 414,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Tell It Like It Is",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 738.97,
      "to": 740.41,
      "sid": 415,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "People who are not from here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 740.41,
      "to": 741.85,
      "sid": 416,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Why would they want to come and work here?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 741.85,
      "to": 743.93,
      "sid": 417,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Some might prefer to stay closer to home.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 743.93,
      "to": 746.72,
      "sid": 418,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or they might be used to it or for other reasons, they stay in this area.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 746.72,
      "to": 750.539,
      "sid": 419,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After all, you are one of the few Asians in this hospital, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 750.539,
      "to": 754.56,
      "sid": 420,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Have you encountered any unfriendly or discriminatory issues as a foreigner?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 754.56,
      "to": 755.6,
      "sid": 421,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "One aspect might be",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 755.6,
      "to": 758.76,
      "sid": 422,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That I am considered a doctor in their eyes.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 758.76,
      "to": 760.72,
      "sid": 423,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Strictly speaking, I am here to assist them.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 760.72,
      "to": 762.36,
      "sid": 424,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then there wasn't any specific conflict.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 762.36,
      "to": 763.5,
      "sid": 425,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In a sense,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 763.5,
      "to": 765.58,
      "sid": 426,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You also know there's a power disparity here.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 765.58,
      "to": 766.2,
      "sid": 427,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In a way,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 766.2,
      "to": 767.12,
      "sid": 428,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They need to please me.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 767.12,
      "to": 769.86,
      "sid": 429,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although I don't directly control whether they get released or not,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 769.86,
      "to": 771.9,
      "sid": 430,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As a healthcare provider,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 771.9,
      "to": 774.14,
      "sid": 431,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "My assessment of them is crucial.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 774.14,
      "to": 776.27,
      "sid": 432,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even if there's some underlying urgency.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 776.27,
      "to": 777.75,
      "sid": 433,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They might not be able to express it to me",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 777.75,
      "to": 779.61,
      "sid": 434,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because there's no benefit for them in doing so",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 779.61,
      "to": 779.87,
      "sid": 435,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 779.87,
      "to": 781.59,
      "sid": 436,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but overall, I feel very welcomed",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 781.59,
      "to": 783.64,
      "sid": 437,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What level of improvement is required for discharge?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 783.64,
      "to": 784.9,
      "sid": 438,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "When he is discharged",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 784.9,
      "to": 788.28,
      "sid": 439,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he is often not directly released back into the community",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 788.28,
      "to": 789.24,
      "sid": 440,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "in our facility",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 789.24,
      "to": 791.2,
      "sid": 441,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's essentially a high-level psychiatric hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 791.2,
      "to": 792.48,
      "sid": 442,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They think your functions are quite good.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 792.48,
      "to": 796.58,
      "sid": 443,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They can place you in some dormitories in the community.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 796.58,
      "to": 798.36,
      "sid": 444,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Once you get there,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 798.36,
      "to": 800.84,
      "sid": 445,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "the place will also provide you with some medical services.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 800.84,
      "to": 802.28,
      "sid": 446,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But they manage you less strictly.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 802.28,
      "to": 804.54,
      "sid": 447,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "At that time, you can go out and do some part-time jobs.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 804.54,
      "to": 805.68,
      "sid": 448,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although many patients say,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 805.68,
      "to": 806.12,
      "sid": 449,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I went out,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 806.12,
      "to": 807.32,
      "sid": 450,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I want to go straight to where I want to go.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 807.32,
      "to": 808.44,
      "sid": 451,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Living with my mom",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 808.44,
      "to": 809.82,
      "sid": 452,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or going somewhere, uh",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 809.82,
      "to": 812.6,
      "sid": 453,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "living with my wife or my kids",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 812.6,
      "to": 815.98,
      "sid": 454,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "generally speaking, such requests are not allowed",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 815.98,
      "to": 817.5,
      "sid": 455,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because the logic is simple",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 817.5,
      "to": 820.46,
      "sid": 456,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you committed a crime in that environment, which led to your incarceration",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 820.46,
      "to": 822.51,
      "sid": 457,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "we don’t really trust that putting you back there would be safe",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 822.51,
      "to": 824.57,
      "sid": 458,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they can provide you with the knowledge you need",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 824.57,
      "to": 825.67,
      "sid": 459,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "from when you were at home",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 825.67,
      "to": 827.95,
      "sid": 460,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Your parents have never taken you to see a mental health professional",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 827.95,
      "to": 829.91,
      "sid": 461,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "nor have they supervised your medication",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 829.91,
      "to": 830.67,
      "sid": 462,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So what happened next?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 830.67,
      "to": 833.41,
      "sid": 463,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "When you were doing some odd things",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 833.41,
      "to": 833.81,
      "sid": 464,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "no one intervened",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 833.81,
      "to": 835.65,
      "sid": 465,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Now you're receiving treatment in that place",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 835.65,
      "to": 836.61,
      "sid": 466,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and someone is looking after you",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 836.61,
      "to": 838.81,
      "sid": 467,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and you might gain a bit more independence",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 838.81,
      "to": 841.45,
      "sid": 468,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "like finding a job and working for a while until it's about right",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 841.45,
      "to": 843.01,
      "sid": 469,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Then they might decide from there",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 843.01,
      "to": 845.43,
      "sid": 470,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "whether they can take you home or not",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 845.43,
      "to": 848.67,
      "sid": 471,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I had a meal at a restaurant near your hospital before",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 848.67,
      "to": 850.51,
      "sid": 472,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and a local grandma said",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 850.51,
      "to": 854.13,
      "sid": 473,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "your hospital doesn’t take good care of patients",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 855.68,
      "to": 857.2,
      "sid": 474,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I basically agree",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 857.2,
      "to": 860.5,
      "sid": 475,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "if you’re treating them as patients",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 860.5,
      "to": 863.36,
      "sid": 476,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it’s true that in terms of the medical services provided",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 863.36,
      "to": 865.22,
      "sid": 477,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "there are often times",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 865.22,
      "to": 867.16,
      "sid": 478,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There's no way to meet these patients' needs",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 867.16,
      "to": 868.66,
      "sid": 479,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the other hand",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 868.66,
      "to": 871.049,
      "sid": 480,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it's not entirely a hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 871.049,
      "to": 872.229,
      "sid": 481,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "although it's called a hospital",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 872.229,
      "to": 872.809,
      "sid": 482,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but as I said",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 872.809,
      "to": 875.189,
      "sid": 483,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because these people are forced to be here",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 875.189,
      "to": 877.25,
      "sid": 484,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it has certain prison-like attributes",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 877.25,
      "to": 878.29,
      "sid": 485,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What's different",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 878.29,
      "to": 879.17,
      "sid": 486,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is the norm",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 879.17,
      "to": 880.25,
      "sid": 487,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As natural beings,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 880.25,
      "to": 881.41,
      "sid": 488,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "most of the time,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 881.41,
      "to": 883.85,
      "sid": 489,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you don't need to prove that you're a good person.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 883.85,
      "to": 885.55,
      "sid": 490,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even when you do nothing,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 885.55,
      "to": 887.71,
      "sid": 491,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you are naturally considered a good person.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 887.71,
      "to": 889.27,
      "sid": 492,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "In this hospital,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 889.27,
      "to": 890.39,
      "sid": 493,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "once you step in,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 890.39,
      "to": 891.43,
      "sid": 494,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "even if you do nothing,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 891.43,
      "to": 892.91,
      "sid": 495,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "you will naturally be considered a bad person.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 892.91,
      "to": 896.209,
      "sid": 496,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So you need to work really hard to prove yourself in this hospital.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 896.209,
      "to": 897.749,
      "sid": 497,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although I have a criminal record,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 897.749,
      "to": 899.109,
      "sid": 498,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I will behave well.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 899.109,
      "to": 901.869,
      "sid": 499,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To show that the criminal record isn't who I truly am.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 901.869,
      "to": 901.989,
      "sid": 500,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 901.989,
      "to": 903.949,
      "sid": 501,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I think there might be some fundamental differences in logic,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 903.949,
      "to": 908.04,
      "sid": 502,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "compared to ordinary psychiatric hospitals.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 908.04,
      "to": 910.8,
      "sid": 503,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "On the other hand, as we mentioned,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 910.8,
      "to": 912.52,
      "sid": 504,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "it is, after all, a state-run psychiatric facility.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 912.52,
      "to": 913.16,
      "sid": 505,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's public.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 913.16,
      "to": 914.74,
      "sid": 506,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So it's funded by taxpayers' money.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 914.74,
      "to": 916.26,
      "sid": 507,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The funding has always been tight.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 916.26,
      "to": 917.45,
      "sid": 508,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Objectively speaking,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 918.11,
      "to": 921.27,
      "sid": 509,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "many patients receive very limited medical resources.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 921.27,
      "to": 922.19,
      "sid": 510,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There's no way around it.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 922.19,
      "to": 923.19,
      "sid": 511,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To be objective,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 923.19,
      "to": 927.3,
      "sid": 512,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "improving the quality of healthcare services is actually quite straightforward.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 927.3,
      "to": 928.34,
      "sid": 513,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As long as there's money.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 928.34,
      "to": 930.22,
      "sid": 514,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Everyone can provide excellent medical services",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 930.22,
      "to": 933.33,
      "sid": 515,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Just like many private hospitals we commonly see, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 933.33,
      "to": 934.73,
      "sid": 516,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the money for private hospitals",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 934.73,
      "to": 936.13,
      "sid": 517,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Comes from the patients themselves",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 936.13,
      "to": 936.81,
      "sid": 518,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The more you pay",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 936.81,
      "to": 938.35,
      "sid": 519,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "The better service you can enjoy",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 938.35,
      "to": 939.61,
      "sid": 520,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But if no one is willing to pay",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 939.61,
      "to": 941.22,
      "sid": 521,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And only the state government is expected to foot the bill",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 941.22,
      "to": 942.9,
      "sid": 522,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That would indeed be quite challenging",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 942.9,
      "to": 947.28,
      "sid": 523,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I think your facility doesn't provide enough care for mental health patients.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 947.28,
      "to": 948.44,
      "sid": 524,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But the amount of money you spend",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 948.44,
      "to": 949.88,
      "sid": 525,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "is actually much more than what it costs to maintain a regular prisoner.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 949.88,
      "to": 952.43,
      "sid": 526,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right, right, right.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 952.43,
      "to": 953.51,
      "sid": 527,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It does cost significantly more than a regular prisoner.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 953.51,
      "to": 955.31,
      "sid": 528,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So, do you think there's a better way?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 955.31,
      "to": 957.91,
      "sid": 529,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To be honest,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 957.91,
      "to": 958.63,
      "sid": 530,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm telling it like it is",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 959.59,
      "to": 962.329,
      "sid": 531,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Although I work in the mental health system",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 962.329,
      "to": 965.049,
      "sid": 532,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'm still a bit puzzled about what counts as fair in this situation",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 965.049,
      "to": 967.35,
      "sid": 533,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I have some of my own uncertainties",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 967.35,
      "to": 968.09,
      "sid": 534,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As I mentioned",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 968.09,
      "to": 971.63,
      "sid": 535,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "You might argue that they weren't of sound mind when they committed the crime",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 971.63,
      "to": 972.57,
      "sid": 536,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But objectively speaking",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 972.57,
      "to": 974.74,
      "sid": 537,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "someone was harmed in the process",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 974.74,
      "to": 976.1,
      "sid": 538,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they were ultimately found not guilty",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 976.1,
      "to": 977.28,
      "sid": 539,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because of their mental illness",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 977.28,
      "to": 979.12,
      "sid": 540,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What should the person who has been hurt do?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 979.12,
      "to": 983.47,
      "sid": 541,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "No one takes responsibility or pays for the harm done to them.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 983.47,
      "to": 986.13,
      "sid": 542,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If we simply view him as a patient,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 986.13,
      "to": 988.47,
      "sid": 543,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I think it's because not all mental illnesses",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 988.47,
      "to": 991.21,
      "sid": 544,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and in fact, most people with mental illnesses",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 991.21,
      "to": 994.1,
      "sid": 545,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "aren't highly aggressive, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 994.1,
      "to": 996.78,
      "sid": 546,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Most of the time, they harm themselves",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 996.78,
      "to": 997.92,
      "sid": 547,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "rather than others.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 997.92,
      "to": 999.3,
      "sid": 548,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "So, from this perspective,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 999.3,
      "to": 1001.86,
      "sid": 549,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I think we've invested a lot of resources",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1001.86,
      "to": 1004.82,
      "sid": 550,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "into treating those with mental illnesses who have harmed others",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1004.82,
      "to": 1007.48,
      "sid": 551,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and this makes me feel a bit uneasy",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1007.48,
      "to": 1010.16,
      "sid": 552,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "or somewhat unfair",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1010.16,
      "to": 1011.12,
      "sid": 553,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "because in other jobs and internships, I've seen many patients",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1011.12,
      "to": 1015.509,
      "sid": 554,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "who are just as severely ill",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1015.509,
      "to": 1016.709,
      "sid": 555,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "but they have never harmed anyone",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1016.709,
      "to": 1018.569,
      "sid": 556,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and they work hard to overcome their mental illnesses",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1022.08,
      "to": 1023.04,
      "sid": 557,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But in this process,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1023.04,
      "to": 1023.56,
      "sid": 558,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "As I mentioned,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1023.56,
      "to": 1024.6,
      "sid": 559,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It might be due to poverty,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1024.6,
      "to": 1027.08,
      "sid": 560,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or perhaps other objective reasons",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1027.08,
      "to": 1028.75,
      "sid": 561,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "There's no way to overcome it.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1028.75,
      "to": 1030.63,
      "sid": 562,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you really want my opinion,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1030.63,
      "to": 1031.59,
      "sid": 563,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I'd give them the money,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1031.59,
      "to": 1033.45,
      "sid": 564,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's far more worthwhile than sending money to such places.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1033.45,
      "to": 1035.879,
      "sid": 565,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But on the other hand, if you don't take up the sword,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1035.879,
      "to": 1036.719,
      "sid": 566,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This is like building a prison",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1036.719,
      "to": 1037.719,
      "sid": 567,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you don’t build a mental health facility",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1037.719,
      "to": 1038.519,
      "sid": 568,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To lock them up",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1038.519,
      "to": 1039.459,
      "sid": 569,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After they commit crimes",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1039.459,
      "to": 1040.839,
      "sid": 570,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "No matter where you send them",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1040.839,
      "to": 1044.58,
      "sid": 571,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They will eventually return to the community",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1044.58,
      "to": 1045.76,
      "sid": 572,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And they will likely reoffend",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1045.76,
      "to": 1047.32,
      "sid": 573,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you don’t treat them, right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1047.32,
      "to": 1049.12,
      "sid": 574,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They will remain a source of social instability",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1049.12,
      "to": 1049.96,
      "sid": 575,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "To be objective,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1049.96,
      "to": 1053.11,
      "sid": 576,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "many of them aren't really that cruel,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1053.11,
      "to": 1055.87,
      "sid": 577,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "what I mentioned earlier were mostly high-profile cases,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1055.87,
      "to": 1058.36,
      "sid": 578,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "some people's cases really aren't that serious,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1058.36,
      "to": 1059.4,
      "sid": 579,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "when you think about these people,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1059.4,
      "to": 1060.22,
      "sid": 580,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "he's also quite,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1060.22,
      "to": 1062.0,
      "sid": 581,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "and objectively, they do need help,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1062.0,
      "to": 1062.2,
      "sid": 582,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "they",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1062.2,
      "to": 1063.62,
      "sid": 583,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "are different from those in prison.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1063.62,
      "to": 1064.96,
      "sid": 584,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They truly need help.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1064.96,
      "to": 1068.72,
      "sid": 585,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because their mental illnesses can't be solved by imprisonment.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1068.72,
      "to": 1070.67,
      "sid": 586,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Imprisoning them just means they will be released eventually.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1070.67,
      "to": 1072.31,
      "sid": 587,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Prison is not a place where you lock someone up forever.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1072.31,
      "to": 1073.15,
      "sid": 588,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They don't stay there for life.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1073.15,
      "to": 1074.39,
      "sid": 589,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Especially for these individuals,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1074.39,
      "to": 1075.33,
      "sid": 590,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "many of whom have minor offenses.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1075.33,
      "to": 1077.12,
      "sid": 591,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They serve two or three years and are released.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1077.12,
      "to": 1079.5,
      "sid": 592,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Considering their own criminal behavior",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1079.5,
      "to": 1081.14,
      "sid": 593,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Indeed, a lot of times he can't control himself.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1081.14,
      "to": 1081.68,
      "sid": 594,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Right?",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1081.68,
      "to": 1082.64,
      "sid": 595,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's like when you talk about him, it's as if you're talking about him.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1082.64,
      "to": 1085.349,
      "sid": 596,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Sometimes he suddenly feels like someone is possessed by a big egg.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1085.349,
      "to": 1086.029,
      "sid": 597,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This matter.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1086.029,
      "to": 1087.709,
      "sid": 598,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you don't receive mental health treatment,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1087.709,
      "to": 1088.99,
      "sid": 599,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you don't take psychiatric medication,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1088.99,
      "to": 1091.77,
      "sid": 600,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's not something he can control through his own will.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1091.77,
      "to": 1093.47,
      "sid": 601,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "From a personal interest standpoint,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1093.47,
      "to": 1096.33,
      "sid": 602,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I wouldn't say I'm willing to be a mentor for life,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1096.33,
      "to": 1098.13,
      "sid": 603,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Or walk alongside the judicial system,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1098.13,
      "to": 1100.29,
      "sid": 604,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "But on the other hand, it is a very valuable experience.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1100.29,
      "to": 1102.05,
      "sid": 605,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because you get to meet many people,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1102.05,
      "to": 1105.82,
      "sid": 606,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "People or patients you would never encounter in your normal life.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1105.82,
      "to": 1107.46,
      "sid": 607,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "They have their own unique issues.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1107.46,
      "to": 1108.7,
      "sid": 608,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Sometimes you realize,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1108.7,
      "to": 1111.04,
      "sid": 609,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "What we call mental health issues,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1111.04,
      "to": 1113.22,
      "sid": 610,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Is both a physiological and a social problem.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1113.22,
      "to": 1114.72,
      "sid": 611,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "For a person's social environment,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1114.72,
      "to": 1116.64,
      "sid": 612,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Life background,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1116.64,
      "to": 1117.38,
      "sid": 613,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And when you help them,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1117.38,
      "to": 1118.84,
      "sid": 614,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How to consider the social aspect,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1118.84,
      "to": 1121.47,
      "sid": 615,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How the system has led them to this point,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1121.47,
      "to": 1123.79,
      "sid": 616,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And when they need to make changes,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1123.79,
      "to": 1125.71,
      "sid": 617,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "How they can reintegrate into the system.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1125.71,
      "to": 1127.51,
      "sid": 618,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Of course, as I always say,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1127.51,
      "to": 1128.27,
      "sid": 619,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "I really find it interesting,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1129.65,
      "to": 1131.05,
      "sid": 620,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Because I studied for a year,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1131.05,
      "to": 1132.49,
      "sid": 621,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And then I moved on to do something else.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1132.49,
      "to": 1133.53,
      "sid": 622,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "My supervisor is quite old now,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1135.09,
      "to": 1137.25,
      "sid": 623,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "My supervisor is already quite advanced in age.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.4"
    },
    {
      "from": 1137.25,
      "to": 1139.22,
      "sid": 624,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And he has worked at this traditional Chinese medicine hospital for 45 years.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1139.22,
      "to": 1142.04,
      "sid": 625,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He says that back when he was a doctoral student interning here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1142.04,
      "to": 1143.12,
      "sid": 626,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "After he interned elsewhere for a while,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1143.12,
      "to": 1146.54,
      "sid": 627,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "When deciding on his future career path,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1146.54,
      "to": 1149.24,
      "sid": 628,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He thought about all the places he had worked at,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1149.24,
      "to": 1151.58,
      "sid": 629,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Which place intrigued him the most,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1151.58,
      "to": 1154.42,
      "sid": 630,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Which place he was most curious about,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1154.42,
      "to": 1157.51,
      "sid": 631,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He found that this 'China Hui',",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1157.51,
      "to": 1159.25,
      "sid": 632,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And the Florida State Hospital were the most intriguing to him,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1159.25,
      "to": 1161.15,
      "sid": 633,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "This made him want to learn more,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1161.15,
      "to": 1164.44,
      "sid": 634,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Working for 45 years,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1164.44,
      "to": 1166.1,
      "sid": 635,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He still finds it fascinating,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1166.1,
      "to": 1166.92,
      "sid": 636,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "A lot of things happen here,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1166.92,
      "to": 1168.52,
      "sid": 637,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "That he finds truly amazing.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1168.52,
      "to": 1169.88,
      "sid": 638,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Humans are truly amazing.",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1169.88,
      "to": 1171.56,
      "sid": 639,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "Even in his 70s,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1171.56,
      "to": 1172.98,
      "sid": 640,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "He hasn't retired yet,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1172.98,
      "to": 1174.0,
      "sid": 641,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If he retired,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1174.0,
      "to": 1174.96,
      "sid": 642,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It might be hard to find a successor,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1174.96,
      "to": 1175.92,
      "sid": 643,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "It's a tough match, and not highly valued,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1175.92,
      "to": 1177.04,
      "sid": 644,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "And objectively speaking,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
    },
    {
      "from": 1177.04,
      "to": 1178.91,
      "sid": 645,
      "location": 2,
      "content": "If you worry about your safety,",
      "music": 0.0,
      "version": "qwen72_v0.0.0"
